  "subtitle": "A short, close-fitting all-rib cap for cold-weather wear.",
  "excerpt": "A bottom-up watch cap worked in 1 x 1 rib throughout on DK yarn. The short, all-rib construction sits low on the brow and pulls flat against the head for maximum warmth in wind. Fits adult heads 54 to 61 cm.",
