      "slug": "watch-cap",
      "term": "Watch cap",
      "definition": "A short, close-fitting knitted cap with an all-rib construction. Originally worn by sailors and navy personnel for warmth on deck. The rib stretches to grip the head and does not ride up."
    },
    {
      "slug": "magic-loop",
      "term": "Magic loop",
      "definition": "A method of knitting a small circumference on one long circular needle by pulling a loop of cable through the work at the halfway point."
    }
